SUMMARY:Alaska: State corporate income/franchise tax return due
DESCRIPTION:Due 15th day of 5th month after year end (May 15)\; automatic e
 xtension to 15th day of month following the federal extended due date (Nove
 mber 15). | Due 15th day of 5th month after year end (May 15)\; automatic e
 xtension to 15th day of month following the federal extended due date (Nove
 mber 15). | Authority: Direct fetch of Alaska DOR Form 6000 Instructions PD
 F this session (accessed directly via the document viewer URL\, bypassing a
  robots.txt block on the HTML site)\, corroborated by a 2024 mirror of the 
 same official instructions: "C Corporations\, generally - Filing due date: 
 15th of the fifth month\; Extended due date: 15th of the eleventh month." |
  Source: https://tax.alaska.gov/programs/documentviewer/viewer.aspx?6661f |
